      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "DNA isolation from L. piscium MKFS47 (hereafter called simply L. piscium) grown in de Man-Rogosa-Sharpe (MRS) broth was done by using a method (17) modified from the one described previously by Pitcher et al. (18), and the genomic DNA was mechanically sheared with a needle."
